## What failed (do not repeat blindly)

An earlier attempt added sentinels + UI “None” rows, then refactored brand/location to name strings. Fixes for nested `NavigationLink(destination:)` back-stack quirks (`NavigationStack` wrapper, `NavigationLink(value:)`, Button + `navigationDestination(item:)`) caused **UI freezes** (attribute tap, then Filter button).

## Current baseline

- Classic `NavigationLink(destination:)` in Item/Outfit filter UIs (do not change)
- Category **Uncategorized** stays (`categoryNotSetFilterValue`)
- Brand **None** shipped via sentinel (`brandNotSetFilterValue` / `selectedBrandName`) — same pattern as category; no nav changes
- Still no None for size/color/location/tags (or outfit category/tags)

